te viral infection (low-tier despite recent cold due to high WBC and elevated LAP)", "Diabetic-related complication (lower-tier because symptoms are non-specific and multisystemic)"], "alarm_features": ["Constitutional symptoms: weight loss, fever", "Hematologic abnormalities: leukocytosis with elevated LAP"]}, "branches": {"B1": {"id": "B1", "label": "Chronic Myeloproliferative Neoplasm", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "expanded", "prior": 0.4, "posterior": 0.42140190792202414, "danger": 0.8, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": [], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": ["B1.1", "B1.2", "B1.3", "B1.4"], "closure_reason": "", "reopen_triggers": [], "askable_discriminators": ["Is the neutrophil alkaline phosphatase score elevated?", "Are Philadelphia chromosome/BCR-ABL mutations detectable?", "Is there evidence of organomegaly (splenomegaly commonly seen in chronic MPN)?", "Is there a history of constitutional symptoms persisting for weeks?"], "requestable_discriminators": ["Bone marrow biopsy for blast percentage", "FISH for BCR-ABL", "Flow cytometry to assess lineage", "Abdominal ultrasound for splenomegaly"], "turn_cost_to_refine": 2.5, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.75, "interrupt_relevance": 0.7, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "test_pathway"}, "B2": {"id": "B2", "label": "Lymphoproliferative / Plasma Cell Disorder", "level": 1, "status": "parked", "posterior": 0.09332227291580256, "danger": 0.6, "parent": "ROOT", "closure_reason": "", "evidence_against": ["Absence of lymphocytosis and atypical morphology contradicts both CLL and lymphomas in this context."]}, "B3": {"id": "B3", "label": "Reactive / Non-malignant Leukocytosis", "level": 1, "status": "parked", "posterior": 0.1493156366652841, "danger": 0.3, "parent": "ROOT", "closure_reason": "", "evidence_against": []}, "B4": {"id": "B4", "label": "Hematologic Neoplasm with Myeloid Lineage Distinction", "level": 